SUBJ/TROPICAL CYCLONE FORMATION ALERT (INVEST 92W) CANCELLATION//
WTIO21 PGTW 281730
RMKS/
1. THIS CANCELS REF A (WTIO21 PGTW 271730) THE AREA OF 
CONVECTION (INVEST 92W) PREVIOUSLY LOCATED NEAR 14.4N 98.0E IS NOW 
LOCATED NEAR 17.4N 97.4E, APPROXIMATELY LOCATED 78 NM WEST-SOUTHWEST OF 
YANGON, MYANMAR. ANIMATED SHORTWAVE INFRARED SATELLITE IMAGERY DEPICTS A 
RAPIDLY DETERIORATING LOW-LEVEL CIRCULATION CENTER (LLCC) THAT IS 
TRACKING INLAND FROM THE WEST COAST OF MYANMAR, WHILE RADAR IMAGERY 
CONFIRMS THAT THE LLCC IS OPENING UP. MODEL GUIDANCE INDICATES THAT THE 
CIRCULATION WILL CONTINUE TO PUSH INLAND AND DISSIPATE OVER LAND.
MAXIMUM SUSTAINED SURFACE WINDS ARE ESTIMATED AT 25 TO 30 KNOTS.
MINIMUM SEA LEVEL PRESSURE IS ESTIMATED TO BE NEAR 1003 MB.  92W IS DISSIPATING AND IS NO LONGER SUSPECT FOR THE DEVELOPMENT OF A SIGNIFICANT TROPICAL CYCLONE IN THE NEXT 24 HOURS.
